{"id":"618a84074ee91eb78c5c58d8dcd0c313a95f8359","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231421","title":"有性价比高的模型 api 推荐吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Rayvonme","excerpt":"问与答 - @Rayvonme - 识图取标题，输出英文长标题，电商用有几十万个图片需要批处理","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>识图取标题，输出英文长标题，电商用</p><p>有几十万个图片需要批处理</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/API\"><li></li> API</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/电商\"><li></li> 电商</a></P><p><span>3 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-01 15:49:03 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17927263\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e19/9a9b/613340_normal.png?m=1751383743\" alt=\"usrpp\" data-uid=\"613340\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/usrpp\">usrpp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 15:19:17 +08:00\">21h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个用 gemini 就好，pixel 渠道很便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17927288\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/626d/dccd/62211_normal.png?m=1757171598\" alt=\"TimePPT\" data-uid=\"62211\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TimePPT\">TimePPT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-01 15:37:35 +08:00\">21h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这种需求又不难找个小点的 image caption 模型就行。<br>省事就 gemini 的 flash 系列或者 gpt 5.6 luna 就行<br>国内可以看看千问的 vl 模型</p>\n                